            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "<h1>REMEDIUM: SENTINELS - OUT NOW!</h1><p></p><br><h1>SCHOLAR OF THE ARCANE ARTS - OUT NOW IN EARLY ACCESS</h1><p></p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/320630/extras/ecbbe0b40c26eed96923b3f008e87a2b.webp?t=1691594266\" width=300 height=56 /></span><br>The story of Season Match starts when the Snow Queen has her magic mirror broken, and decides to make cold winter stay forever in the fairy-land. You will set out on a legendary journey to find the pieces of the broken mirror, put them together and beat the Snow Queen. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/320630/extras/52c6b459d9cf43697d54c3b216eeebf1.webp?t=1691594266\" width=227 height=56 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Four seasons<br></li><li>Over 250 missions<br></li><li>Fantastic characters<br></li><li>Easy-to-Play for all ages<br></li><li>Learn-as-you-play tutorial<br></li><li>Awesome music</li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/320630/extras/ecbbe0b40c26eed96923b3f008e87a2b.webp?t=1691594266\" width=300 height=56 /></span><br>The story of Season Match starts when the Snow Queen has her magic mirror broken, and decides to make cold winter stay forever in the fairy-land. You will set out on a legendary journey to find the pieces of the broken mirror, put them together and beat the Snow Queen. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/320630/extras/52c6b459d9cf43697d54c3b216eeebf1.webp?t=1691594266\" width=227 height=56 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Four seasons<br></li><li>Over 250 missions<br></li><li>Fantastic characters<br></li><li>Easy-to-Play for all ages<br></li><li>Learn-as-you-play tutorial<br></li><li>Awesome music</li></ul>",
